# NF 1.51 – NotFox for Android and Fire TV

Kodi 21.3 repackaged with notfox 4.5.2, IPTV Simple, InputStream Adaptive and Elementum built in. It installs as its own app, next to Kodi rather than over it.

## Downloads
- NF.apk: phones and tablets (64-bit Android)
- NF-firetv.apk: Fire TV Stick and other 32-bit devices

Installing over an earlier NF keeps your setup.

## What's new in 1.51
- NF checks this page for updates by itself once a day and offers each new version.

## Also in 1.50
- The profile picture in the corner of the home screen can be turned off: ACTIVE > Profiles > Profile Picture in the Corner.

## Also in 1.49
- Continue Watching and My List on ON DEMAND, and Add to My List on every film and show
- Filters for Movies and TV Shows (rating, years, language), set for each profile
- Next episode offered when an episode ends
- Channel banner MENU: Record, Record Every Episode, Reminder, Favourite
- Catch-up from the guide, on channels whose stream supports it
- Kids profiles (Kids & Family only, no torrents), profile PINs, your own pictures, text size for each profile
- Hide a channel just for your profile
- Cloud Sync recovery code; reminders, series recordings, My List and filters now sync
- Faster lists, Memory Saver on Fire TV, a smaller app, a low-space warning
- Sources Health page, and dead torrent sources retried weekly
- Help pages and a TV-friendly first run

Only add channel lists and torrent sources you have the right to use.
